i nobili e raccomandati di corte) e si offre come prossima vittima del drago. Spetterà a Galen sconfiggere definitivamente il mostro.","tagline":"Nei secoli bui, la magia era un'arma. L'amore era un mistero. L'avventura era ovunque... E i draghi erano reali."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"A sorcerer and his apprentice are on a mission to kill an evil dragon to save the King’s daughter from being sacrificed according to a pact that the King himself made with the dragon to protect his kingdom.","tagline":"In the Dark Ages, Magic was a weapon. Love was a mystery. Adventure was everywhere...And Dragons were real."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/giW3FtFH23JFKTgS6V9O9EX4gWB.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wbNKvMdPgOjrsydymIXxHLqIlOZ.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":848,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"en-US","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/giW3FtFH23JFKTgS6V9O9EX4gWB.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/giW3FtFH23JFKTgS6V9O9EX4gWB.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/giW3FtFH23JFKTgS6V9O9EX4gWB.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/giW3FtFH23JFKTgS6V9O9EX4gWB.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/92VXAEwbjebYqTeUa7uX5bBtDuD.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/92VXAEwbjebYqTeUa7uX5bBtDuD.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/92VXAEwbjebYqTeUa7uX5bBtDuD.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/92VXAEwbjebYqTeUa7uX5bBtDuD.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image